sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator screen
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant P as Plate
  Note over S,P: Robot is at spot 8, Plate step.<br/>Plate is pushed into fastening position,<br/>then the live camera + tripwire check it.
  S->>P: CMD_START (spot 8)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLACEMENT_REJECTED), plate released and clear
  S->>P: CMD_START (retry 1 of 2, push plate again)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLACEMENT_REJECTED)
  S->>P: CMD_START (retry 2 of 2, push plate again)
  P-->>S: FAULT (PLACEMENT_REJECTED)
  S->>Op: ALERT: robot stopped. Spot 8, Plate, PLACEMENT_REJECTED
  Note over S: Stack light turns flashing amber, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Robot waits at spot 8.<br/>Nothing moves.<br/>Operator can watch the live feed.
  alt Operator can fix it
    Op->>S: RESOLVED (fixed on the robot)
    S->>P: CMD_START (resume same step)
    P-->>S: DONE
    Note over S: Spot continues with the next step
  else Operator cannot fix it (last resort)
    Op->>S: SKIP_SPOT
    Note over S: Supervisor logs the spot as skipped, then advances to the next spot
  end
